{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21217","headline":"冬夜怀李侍御王太祝段丞 · 元稹","name":"冬夜怀李侍御王太祝段丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浩露烟壒尽，月光闲有余。\n松篁细阴影，重以帘牖疎。\n泛览星粲粲，轻河悠碧虚。\n纤云不成叶，脉脉风丝舒。\n丹竈炽东序，烧香罗玉书。\n飘飘魂神举，若骖鸾鹤舆。\n感念夙昔意，华尚簪与裾。\n簪裾讵几许，累创吞钩鱼。\n今闻馨香道，一以悟臭帤。\n悟觉誓不惑，永抱胎仙居。\n昼夜欣所适，安知岁云除。\n行行二三友，君怀复何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}